// MOS 65xx SAIL Project
// Build order for the MOS 6502 family specification

prelude.sail
core.sail
sys.sail
instructions.sail
model.sail

// =============================================================================
// Variants - Uncomment the chain for your target CPU
// =============================================================================
//
// Inheritance hierarchy:
//   6502 (base - always included above)
//     └── 65C02 (CMOS improvements + new instructions)
//           └── R65C02 (Rockwell bit manipulation: RMB, SMB, BBR, BBS)
//                 └── W65C02 (WDC: WAI, STP, bug fixes)
//
// For 65C02:
//   Variants/65c02.sail
//
// For R65C02 (includes 65C02):
//   Variants/65c02.sail
//   Variants/r65c02.sail
//
// For W65C02 (includes R65C02 + 65C02):
//   Variants/65c02.sail
//   Variants/r65c02.sail
//   Variants/w65c02.sail
